  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate and Clean Air Coalition (CCAC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support technical assistance and capacity building activities across mitigation sectors through the deployment of resources in the Climate and Clean Air Coalition (CCAC) Trust Fund, outreach and stakeholder engagement, CCAC Secretariat operations, and the CCAC&apos;s web-based knowledge management system. The CCAC promotes and supports real world action by countries, sub-nationals, the private sector and civil society to reduce emissions of short-lived climate pollutants (SLCPs)-namely black carbon, methane and high-GWP hydrofluorocarbons.</narrative>
  </description>
